  "discussion": "IKE version 2 requires the use of a PRF to generate random data for cryptographic operations. The approved hashing algorithms that can be used for the PRF are HMAC-SHA256, HMAC-SHA384 and HMAC-SHA512.\n\nFor interoperability and maintainability reasons, HMAC-SHA256 will not be approved beyond 2030.",
